   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"2\" type=\"a\">\n  <li>Solve the original equation, then choose the<strong> two</strong> roots.</li>\n</ol>\n<ol type=\"a\">\n  <li><span data-math=\"x = -4\">x = -4</span></li>\n  <li><span data-math=\"x = 12\">x = 12</span></li>\n  <li><span data-math=\"x = -2\">x = -2</span></li>\n  <li><span data-math=\"x = -6\">x = -6</span></li>\n  <li><span data-math=\"x = 4\">x = 4</span></li>\n</ol>",
